+/*
+ * FIFO-mode ops for UART uses.  Vendors that leave the QUP DMA/NoC path
+ * unconfigured (no dmas/interconnects in the DT) can select this with
+ * "qcom,geni-fifo" so that all transfers go through the SE FIFO registers.
+ */
